<p>Hi <%= @candidate.name %>,</p>
<p><%= @company %> has invited you to a short screening interview for <strong><%= @job.title %></strong>.</p>
<p>You'll answer <%= @job.questions.size %> questions out loud, one at a time, with up to <%= @answer_time %> for each. It takes about <%= @total_minutes %> minutes. You'll need a quiet place and a microphone; your camera isn't used.</p>
<p><a href="<%= @url %>" class="button">Start when you're ready</a></p>
<p class="muted">This link is personal to you. Before anything is recorded you'll see how your answers are used and can decide whether to continue.</p>
